{
  "dashboard_name": "K-12 School District Dashboard Template",
  "source": "analytics",
  "report": "# K-12 School District Operations Report\n\n## Overview\nThis dashboard provides Westfield Unified School District leadership with a unified view of enrollment, attendance, graduation outcomes, teacher retention, and open student incidents across all schools in the district.\n\n## Key Metrics\n- Total Enrollment: 4,820\n- Avg Attendance Rate: 94.1%\n- Graduation Rate: 89.3%\n- Teacher Retention Rate: 86.0%\n- Open Incidents: 14\n\n## Insights\n- Attendance at 94.1% is above the state average of 92%; chronic absenteeism monitoring should continue at the middle school level.\n- Graduation rate of 89.3% reflects improvement over prior year — the Special Ed Program Expansion is a contributing factor.\n- Teacher retention at 86% warrants attention; exit interview data should inform the Professional Development project currently in progress.",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "Total Enrollment",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Total Enrollment",
            "data_source": "education",
            "module": "HR Hub",
            "operation": "count",
            "filters": {"status": "Active"}
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "4820"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "Attendance Rate",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Avg Attendance Rate",
            "data_source": "education",
            "module": "HR Hub",
            "operation": "percentage",
            "filters": {}
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "94.1%"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bar",
      "name": "Enrollment by Grade Level",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Students by Grade",
            "data_source": "education",
            "module": "HR Hub",
            "operation": "count",
            "filters": {},
            "group_by": "grade_level"
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "bar chart"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "name": "Attendance Trend",
      "data_config": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Daily Attendance Rate",
            "data_source": "education",
            "module": "HR Hub",
            "operation": "percentage",
            "filters": {}
          }
        ],
        "group_by": ["custom_dates"],
        "date_from": "2025-01-01",
        "date_to": "2025-12-31",
        "date_interval": "monthly",
        "aggregation": "count"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "pie",
      "name": "Incident Type Distribution",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Incidents by Type",
            "data_source": "ticketing",
            "module": "Tickets",
            "operation": "count",
            "filters": {},
            "group_by": "type"
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "pie chart"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "name": "Open District Work Items",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Open Items",
            "data_source": "ticketing",
            "module": "Tickets",
            "operation": "list",
            "filters": {"status": ["Open", "In Progress"]}
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "item list"
      },
      "column_count": 4,
      "column_width": 200
    }
  ]
}
